  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 995729268}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 445e13603f407004589a4378f99edb2c, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DersNotu
  dersBasligi: "Mod\xFCl 2 | Ders 7 | Unity Edit\xF6r\xFCn\xFC Tan\u0131ma"
  amac: "Bu sahne dersin ba\u015F\u0131ndaki durumdur. Gezinme ve ara\xE7 denemelerini
    burada yap\u0131n.\n\nEdit\xF6rde sistemli bir tur at\u0131yoruz. Scene penceresinde
    gezinmeyi, ta\u015F\u0131ma, d\xF6nd\xFCrme ve \xF6l\xE7ekleme ara\xE7lar\u0131n\u0131,
    \u0131zgaraya yap\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rmay\u0131, gizmo \xE7izimini ve Play modunun
    tuzaklar\u0131n\u0131 deniyoruz."
  adimlar:
  - "Unity Hub'da Installs sekmesinde kurulu edit\xF6r s\xFCr\xFCmlerine, Projects
    sekmesinde projenin s\xFCr\xFCm s\xFCtununa bak\u0131n. Projeyi ve Ders07_Baslangic
    sahnesini a\xE7\u0131n."
  - "Scene penceresinde farenin sa\u011F tu\u015Funu bas\u0131l\u0131 tutun ve W,
    A, S, D tu\u015Flar\u0131yla u\xE7un. Bir k\xFCp se\xE7ip F tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n,
    kamera k\xFCpe odaklan\u0131r. Alt tu\u015Funu bas\u0131l\u0131 tutup sol tu\u015Fla
    s\xFCr\xFCkleyin, kamera k\xFCp\xFCn \xE7evresinde d\xF6ner. Sa\u011F \xFCstteki
    eksen k\xFCp\xFCn\xFCn \xFCst koluna t\u0131klay\u0131n, sahneye tepeden bakars\u0131n\u0131z."
  - "W, E ve R tu\u015Flar\u0131yla ta\u015F\u0131ma, d\xF6nd\xFCrme ve \xF6l\xE7ekleme
    ara\xE7lar\u0131 aras\u0131nda ge\xE7i\u015F yap\u0131n. Bir k\xFCp\xFC W arac\u0131yla
    Ctrl tu\u015Fu bas\u0131l\u0131yken s\xFCr\xFCkleyin. Inspector'daki Position
    de\u011Ferleri birer birim de\u011Fi\u015Fir."
  - "\u0130ki k\xFCp\xFC birlikte se\xE7in. Ara\xE7 \xE7ubu\u011Funda Pivot ile Center
    aras\u0131nda, sonra Local ile Global aras\u0131nda ge\xE7i\u015F yap\u0131n.
    Kup2 d\xF6nd\xFCr\xFClm\xFC\u015F oldu\u011Fu i\xE7in Local se\xE7iliyken oklar\u0131n
    y\xF6n\xFC de\u011Fi\u015Fir."
  - "Kapsul nesnesini se\xE7in ve GizmoCiz bile\u015Fenini ekleyin. Scene penceresinde
    sar\u0131 tel k\xFCre g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCr. Yaricap de\u011Ferini 5 yap\u0131n, k\xFCre
    b\xFCy\xFCr. Game penceresindeki Gizmos d\xFC\u011Fmesini kapat\u0131n."
  - "Edit men\xFCs\xFCnden Preferences penceresini a\xE7\u0131n, Colors b\xF6l\xFCm\xFCnde
    Playmode tint rengini a\xE7\u0131k k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 yap\u0131n. Play tu\u015Funa
    bas\u0131n, edit\xF6r renk de\u011Fi\u015Ftirir. Play modunda bir k\xFCp\xFCn
    konumunu de\u011Fi\u015Ftirin ve Play modundan \xE7\u0131k\u0131n. K\xFCp eski
    yerine d\xF6ner."
  - "Yeniden Play tu\u015Funa bas\u0131n ve k\xFCp\xFC ta\u015F\u0131y\u0131n. Transform
    bile\u015Feninin sa\u011F \xFCst\xFCndeki men\xFCden Copy Component se\xE7in.
    Play modundan \xE7\u0131k\u0131n ve ayn\u0131 men\xFCden Paste Component Values
    se\xE7in. K\xFCp yeni konumunda kal\u0131r."
  - "Ctrl ve K tu\u015Flar\u0131yla Search penceresini a\xE7\u0131n, Fixed Timestep
    yaz\u0131n ve Project Settings sonucuna t\u0131klay\u0131n. Window men\xFCs\xFCnden
    Layouts, Save Layout ile pencere d\xFCzeninizi kaydedin."
  kendinDene:
  - "GizmoCiz beti\u011Finde OnDrawGizmosSelected ad\u0131n\u0131 OnDrawGizmos yap\u0131n.
    K\xFCre art\u0131k ne zaman g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor?"
  - "Bir k\xFCp\xFC V tu\u015Fu bas\u0131l\u0131yken k\xF6\u015Fesinden tutup ba\u015Fka
    bir k\xFCp\xFCn k\xF6\u015Fesine yap\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131n."
  - "Window men\xFCs\xFCnden Layouts alt\u0131ndaki haz\u0131r d\xFCzenleri s\u0131rayla
    deneyin ve kendi d\xFCzeninize geri d\xF6n\xFCn."
